# Matsuoka et al. (2023, ApJL 949, L42), Table 2 ("Quasar luminosity function at z = 7"), binned part; checked against arXiv:2305.11225v1
# Sample: 35 quasars = 13 bright quasars from Wang et al. (2019) (z > 6.55, y_AB < 20.8) + 22 SHELLQs quasars
# Redshift: 6.55 < z < 7.15
# Magnitude definition: M1450; bin width 0.5 mag except -27.50 (1.0 mag)
# Phi convention: linear Phi in units of 1e-9 cMpc^-3 mag^-1 (table in Gpc^-3 mag^-1); H0 = 70, Om = 0.3, OL = 0.7
# Note: The bright bins re-use the Wang et al. (2019) quasars, so do not combine this with Wang2019 as an independent constraint.
#
# M1450  Phi  Delta
